{"nodes": [{"id": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "label": "reviewer-ultra-prosecution", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "frontmatter name: reviewer-ultra-prosecution (model sonnet, effort high)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_recall_optimised_review", "label": "Recall-optimised review posture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "lines 43-63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Assume the change is broken and something is there to find. Because the adjudicator discards what cannot be supported, the cost of a weak finding here is low and the cost of a missed real one is high, so the threshold for raising is deliberately lowered \u2014 unproven suspicions still go in, marked `evidence: inferred` and `confidence: low`. Failure is hypothesised actively: for each changed behaviour, ask what input, ordering, or state would break it and work back to the code. Tests are assumed inadequate until the one that would catch the concern is found, and severity is never softened to seem reasonable."}, {"id": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_lower_threshold_not_lower_honesty", "label": "A lower threshold is not lower honesty", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "lines 65-77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Marking a suspicion as `direct` is singled out as the one thing that corrupts adjudication, because the adjudicator weights evidence heavily and cannot re-derive it. `confidence: low` is expected from prosecution and costs nothing. Volume is not licence to review other lanes."}], "edges": [{"source": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "target": "user__claude_skills_dev_loop_ultra_skill_dev_loop_ultra", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "description lines 3-8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "target": "user__claude_skills_dev_loop_ultra_opus_skill_dev_loop_ultra_opus", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "description lines 7-8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "target": "user__claude_skills_solution_architecture_skill_solution_architecture", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "frontmatter skills lines 11-13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "target": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_standards_coding_standards_skill", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "frontmatter skills lines 11-13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "target": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_architecture_lane_ownership_boundary", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-prosecution.md", "source_location": "line 74 \u2014 volume is not licence to review other lanes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_lower_threshol